{"2607180": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Mecha Blitz", "steam_appid": 2607180, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607180/extras/92b0cfd16e65d39f6d911a156cd41502.avif?t=1781178562\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607180/extras_big/92b0cfd16e65d39f6d911a156cd41502.webp?t=1781178562 width=1560 height=323 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Mecha Blitz, players build mechs called 'Arbiters', and fight fast-paced, anime-inspired isometric top down shooter arena battles in both online multiplayer PvP and single player PvE game modes. Customize your robot fighter with a variety of parts, weapons and cosmetics. Upgrade your equipment, abilities and stats as you progress through the game!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armor up, Arbiter, and join us now! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607180/extras/b23d6e0e15b0c4f9e565af4b43e339bb.avif?t=1781178562\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607180/extras_big/b23d6e0e15b0c4f9e565af4b43e339bb.webp?t=1781178562 width=1560 height=323 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build and Customize your Mech.</strong> Choose over 100 parts, internals and weapons to build the Arbiter of your dreams. This number doesn't even include the various other cosmetic options! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Craft and Create the Way you Play.</strong> Different loadouts and setups require different strategies and styles of fighting. From mobile glass cannons to sturdy armored fortresses, long-range snipers to close-range melee... which of these will you be on the battlefield? </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single Player Arcade and other PvE Game modes.</strong> 1v1 ladder matches, survival, time attack, and boss challenges!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online Multiplayer PvP.</strong> Bring your creation online and fight other players in 1v1 duels! The game runs on rollback netcode! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Couch Splitscreen.</strong> Or... fight your friends in offline splitscreen battles. Controllers required!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shop and Upgrades.</strong> Earn currency and upgrades by fighting and winning.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607180/extras/e7aef3ef61b535f2abf6529cf693b7ba.avif?t=1781178562\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607180/extras_big/e7aef3ef61b535f2abf6529cf693b7ba.webp?t=1781178562 width=1560 height=323 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humanity was exiled from Earth by an alien force known as 'Ofania'. Seven Survivor Ships fled to the stars, but seeking to take back their home, they created powerful armored mecha warriors known as 'Arbiters'. You are one of their pilots - the core of a new fighting force, and the last hope of survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607180/extras/3070d8b671df49cba0e2e48da144541f.avif?t=1781178562\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607180/extras_big/3070d8b671df49cba0e2e48da144541f.webp?t=1781178562 width=1560 height=323 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our Discord Community for up-to-date news and updates from the Mecha Blitz team. Discuss and chat with our devs and fellow players about features, feedback and suggestions. Community events, tournaments and promotions will primarily be held in the server as well.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607180/extras/92b0cfd16e65d39f6d911a156cd41502.avif?t=1781178562\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607180/extras_big/92b0cfd16e65d39f6d911a156cd41502.webp?t=1781178562 width=1560 height=323 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Mecha Blitz, players build mechs called 'Arbiters', and fight fast-paced, anime-inspired isometric top down shooter arena battles in both online multiplayer PvP and single player PvE game modes. Customize your robot fighter with a variety of parts, weapons and cosmetics. Upgrade your equipment, abilities and stats as you progress through the game!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armor up, Arbiter, and join us now! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607180/extras/b23d6e0e15b0c4f9e565af4b43e339bb.avif?t=1781178562\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607180/extras_big/b23d6e0e15b0c4f9e565af4b43e339bb.webp?t=1781178562 width=1560 height=323 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build and Customize your Mech.</strong> Choose over 100 parts, internals and weapons to build the Arbiter of your dreams. This number doesn't even include the various other cosmetic options! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Craft and Create the Way you Play.</strong> Different loadouts and setups require different strategies and styles of fighting. From mobile glass cannons to sturdy armored fortresses, long-range snipers to close-range melee... which of these will you be on the battlefield? </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single Player Arcade and other PvE Game modes.</strong> 1v1 ladder matches, survival, time attack, and boss challenges!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online Multiplayer PvP.</strong> Bring your creation online and fight other players in 1v1 duels! The game runs on rollback netcode! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Couch Splitscreen.</strong> Or... fight your friends in offline splitscreen battles. Controllers required!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shop and Upgrades.</strong> Earn currency and upgrades by fighting and winning.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607180/extras/e7aef3ef61b535f2abf6529cf693b7ba.avif?t=1781178562\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607180/extras_big/e7aef3ef61b535f2abf6529cf693b7ba.webp?t=1781178562 width=1560 height=323 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humanity was exiled from Earth by an alien force known as 'Ofania'. Seven Survivor Ships fled to the stars, but seeking to take back their home, they created powerful armored mecha warriors known as 'Arbiters'. You are one of their pilots - the core of a new fighting force, and the last hope of survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607180/extras/3070d8b671df49cba0e2e48da144541f.avif?t=1781178562\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607180/extras_big/3070d8b671df49cba0e2e48da144541f.webp?t=1781178562 width=1560 height=323 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our Discord Community for up-to-date news and updates from the Mecha Blitz team. Discuss and chat with our devs and fellow players about features, feedback and suggestions. Community events, tournaments and promotions will primarily be held in the server as well.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Build mechs and fight in this fast-paced, anime-inspired isometric top down shooter with online multiplayer PvP and single player store and story game modes. Customize your robot fighter with a variety of parts, weapons and cosmetics. Upgrade your equipment, abilities and stats. Armor up!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607180/e5cbce036cff90b7c5218939cc8180c65f8ef4fc/header.jpg?t=1781178562", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607180/fcbbc52bf45a7c5fc052e96b9219d3b1b4d77cca/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1781178562", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607180/fcbbc52bf45a7c5fc052e96b9219d3b1b4d77cca/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1781178562", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> TBA<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> TBA<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> TBA<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> TBA<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> none<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> TBA</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><